The source is "())".
The opened is 0.
The added is 0.
For every spot from 0 to the last position of source.
The symbol is the slice of source from spot to spot plus 1.
If symbol is "(", add 1 to opened.
If symbol is ")", subtract 1 from opened.
If opened is less than 0, add 1 to added, set opened to 0.

Report added.
